### Sample API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 검체 타입 생성 (Create Sample Type)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "BLD",
  "name": "혈액",
  "description": "전혈 검체"
}

### 2. 검체 타입 목록 조회 (Get All Sample Types)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3. 검체 타입 상세 조회 (Get Sample Type by ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4. 검체 타입 조회 - 코드로 (Get Sample Type by Code)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types/code/BLD
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5. 검체 타입 수정 (Update Sample Type)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "BLD",
  "name": "혈액 (수정)",
  "description": "전혈 검체 - 업데이트"
}

### 6. 검체 타입 삭제 (Delete Sample Type)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types/1

### 7. 검체 생성 (Create Sample)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/samples
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "S001",
  "sampleTypeId": 1,
  "collectedBy": "김간호사",
  "note": "정상 채취"
}

### 8. 검체 목록 조회 (Get All Samples)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/samples
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 9. 검체 상세 조회 (Get Sample by ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/samples/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 10. 검체 타입별 조회 (Get Samples by Type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/samples/type/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 11. 검체 정보 수정 (Update Sample)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/samples/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "sampleTypeId": 1,
  "collectedBy": "이간호사",
  "note": "재채취 완료"
}

### 12. 검체 삭제 (Delete Sample)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/samples/1

### 13. 중복 검체 일련번호 체크 (Check Duplicate Serial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/samples/check-serial/S001
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 14. 중복 검체 타입 코드 체크 (Check Duplicate Code)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types/check-code/BLD
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 15. 검체 타입 생성 - 필수값 누락 (Validation Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-types
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "",
  "name": ""
}

### 16. 검체 생성 - 필수값 누락 (Validation Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/samples
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "",
  "sampleTypeId": null
}

### 17. 검체 생성 - 존재하지 않는 타입 (Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/samples
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "S002",
  "sampleTypeId": 99999
}

### 18. 존재하지 않는 검체 조회 (Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/samples/99999
Accept: {{contentType}}
